# The clock lead-in.  alas and ala are both glossed as the adverb "o'clock":
# ala stands before the hour one ("ala una"), alas before every other hour
# ("alas dose").  Wiktionary's ika- entry names alas as the synonym of the
# ordinal-hour construction, which is the other half of this locale's clock.
# en.wiktionary.org, alas; en.wiktionary.org, ala; en.wiktionary.org, ika-.
alas
ala
